{"id": "320731", "name": "התפלגות Y = ⌊X⌋ + 1 עבור X מעריכי", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( X\\sim\\mathsf{Exp}({{CT:0}}) \\)</span> ונגדיר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y = \\lfloor X \\rfloor +1\\)</span>.</p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\"><b>תזכורת</b>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lfloor x \\rfloor = \\max \\{ m \\in \\mathbb{Z} \\ : \\ m \\leq x \\}\\)</span>, זהו השלם הקרוב ביותר ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> מלמטה.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>איזו מהטענות הבאות נכונה לגבי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\)</span>?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מחשבים את פונקציית ההסתברות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\)</span> ומזהים התפלגות גאומטרית; משם נובעות שאר התשובות.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — פונקציית ההסתברות</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\)</span> מקבל רק ערכים שלמים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(k\\geq 1\\)</span>, ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y=k\\)</span> בדיוק כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(k-1\\leq X\\lt k\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}[Y=k]=e^{-{{CT:0}}(k-1)}-e^{-{{CT:0}}k}=\\left(e^{-{{CT:0}} }\\right)^{k-1}\\left(1-e^{-{{CT:0}} }\\right) \\]</p>זו פונקציית ההסתברות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Geo}\\left(1-e^{-{{CT:0}} }\\right)\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — שאר הטענות</b><br>לכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\)</span> בדיד (ולא רציף), ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[Y]=\\frac{1}{1-e^{-{{CT:0}} }}=\\frac{e^{ {{CT:0}} }}{e^{ {{CT:0}} }-1}> 1\\)</span>, בעוד ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{1}{e^{ {{CT:0}} }+1}\\lt 1\\)</span>. הטענה הנכונה:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ Y \\text{ has geometric distribution.} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "checkbox", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "LaTeXdisplaystyle"}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "mcq_correct(ta)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["la", "o1", "o2", "o3", "o4", "ta", "tam"], "nvariants": 50}